(The ledger's file leaves, batch C - docs/ledger/files.md rows FIL-09,
 FIL-15, FIL-16, FIL-18, FIL-19, FIL-20, FIL-21, FIL-27, FIL-28, FIL-30,
 FIL-31, FIL-34, FIL-36, FIL-37, FIL-39, FIL-43, FIL-48, FIL-50.

 Same shape as 382_gen_files_b3.vox: each leaf called directly off a
 pinned rng seed, its emitted source printed in full as the golden. Every
 leaf is rendered at the true top level (nested false) under two seeds,
 chosen so each drawn branch shows, and once inside a block (nested true)
 - except the four leaves that carry an On error (FIL-21, FIL-39, FIL-36/43,
 FIL-48): an On error handler takes a following comma as more of its own
 body, so those are drawn at depth 3 only, where 'gen statement' renders
 nothing nested, the same as every earlier files kind. FIL-37 shows in
 every open line: the clause order differs.)
Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.
Set gen_reads_stdin to true.
Set gen_input to "seven bytes\n".

Print "--- FIL-09: the File Properties worked example ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file properties worked example' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, seed 2 ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file properties worked example' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file properties worked example' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-15: a bare Boolean property as an If condition ---".
'rng seed' of 118786.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list empty guard' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, seed 1 ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list empty guard' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 118786.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list empty guard' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-16, FIL-19, FIL-20: index, first and last agree ---".
