'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list computed index' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, seed 3 ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
